    "intent": "Stop the same three open items (no acceptance record, unanswered decision points, grading values still proposed) from carrying from one item report to the next. The merge becomes the acceptance; the Executor writes the record as the next item's first commit; .rha/decisions.toml owns decision-point status; the CHG-002 acceptance record is written under that rule.",
